        <briefdescription>
<para>Invokes the referred callable. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Not <computeroutput>noexcept</computeroutput>, since a failed <computeroutput>require()</computeroutput> stops the body of a test case by throwing an exception.</para>
<para>Always inlined, so that, without optimisations, it adds no frame between <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1test__case_1adb4333ecb107fee477156b661f0b1512" kindref="member">test_case::run()</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1callable__ref_1affde2e2f927df6b5ada7f5578f8d5c36" kindref="member">invoke_callable()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>self</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The reference passed to the callable. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Returns</title><para>Nothing.</para>
</simplesect>
Passes the stored address and <computeroutput>self</computeroutput> to the stored function. </para>
